question:
What is the primary difference between em and rem units in responsive design?
```css
.parent { font-size: 20px; }
.child { font-size: 1.5em; margin: 1.5rem; }
```

How should this aspect ratio be maintained responsively?
```css
.video {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}
```

In a fluid grid, why might max-width prevent content from scaling infinitely?
```css
.container {
  width: 90%;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
```

How should flexible images be sized to prevent layout shift?
```css
img {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}
```

Why is container queries more flexible than media queries for component styles?
```css
@container (min-width: 400px) {
  .card { display: grid; }
}
```

What is the minimum touch target size for accessibility on mobile?
```css
button {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
}
```

When should padding percentage values be used for responsive layouts?
```css
.ratio-box {
  padding-bottom: 66.66%; /* for 3:2 aspect ratio */
  position: relative;
}
```

How do percentage widths behave in nested flex containers?
```css
.outer { display: flex; width: 100%; }
.inner { flex: 1; width: 50%; }
```
